# ==============================================================================
# WebServarr - Direct Dependencies
# ==============================================================================
# This file lists direct (top-level) dependencies only.
# Run `pip-compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt` to resolve and pin
# the full dependency tree including transitive dependencies.
